WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.752
First, people once paid hundreds of dollars for standalone spell check, yet today it comes free everywhere.

2
00:00:07.092 --> 00:00:13.151
Second, it became free because checking a word costs almost nothing to run inside tools you already use.

3
00:00:13.491 --> 00:00:20.797
Third, new computer intelligence reaches seven billion people only when it runs cheaply on devices people already own.
